PNT P2 10 0 0
PNT P3 10 5 0
PNT P4 0 5 0
PNT P5 0 0 4
PNT P6 10 0 4
PNT P7 10 5 4
PNT P8 0 5 4
PNT C1 7.5 2.5 0
PNT C2 7.5 2.5 4
LINE L1 P1 P2 8
LINE L2 P2 P3 C1 4
LINE L3 P3 P4 8
LINE L4 P4 P1 4
LINE L5 P5 P6 8
LINE L6 P6 P7 C2 4
LINE L7 P7 P8 8
LINE L8 P8 P5 4
LINE L9 P1 P5 2
LINE L10 P2 P6 2
LINE L11 P3 P7 2
LINE L12 P4 P8 2
GSUR A1 + BLEND - L1 - L4 - L3 - L2
GSUR A2 + BLEND + L5 + L6 + L7 + L8
GSUR A3 + BLEND + L1 + L10 - L5 - L9
GSUR A4 + BLEND + L2 + L11 - L6 - L10
GSUR A5 + BLEND + L3 + L12 - L7 - L11
GSUR A6 + BLEND + L4 + L9 - L8 - L12
GBOD B1 NORM + A1 + A2 + A3 + A4 + A5 + A6
PNT P11 0 10 0
PNT P12 10 10 0
PNT P13 10 15 0
PNT P14 0 15 0
LINE L21 P11 P12 8
